#2700
The Dark, Murky Pool~
   You stand knee deep in the water of a dark, murky pool.  The water is
bitterly cold, though not so cold that you need fear for your toes just
yet.  It continues beneath the cave wall to the north and west, but the
gap is far too low to squeeze through.  The great cavern lies to the
east and southeast.
~
