meet.  Wedged into the corner is a throne of scrap iron, old timbers and
stacked stone, so hastily thrown together that it leans to one side,
from which the king of the kobolds oversees his preparations for war.  A
large plan has been daubed on the wall beside the throne in charcoal and
what you hope is red paint.
