#2705
The Winding Tunnel~
   The tunnel twists sharply here, bending back on itself as it follows
a seam of softer rock.  Kobold picks have widened it in places, and the
fresh pale scars on the walls stand out against the old stone like chalk
marks.  Someone has scratched an arrow into the rock, pointing
southeast, beneath a crude drawing of a very large figure with very
small kobolds standing on its shoulders.
~
