#2707
Mouth of the Tunnel above the Chasm~
   The tunnel ends abruptly at the lip of a vast chasm.  Cold air rises
out of a darkness so deep that your light cannot even find the far wall,
and a pebble kicked over the edge falls for a very long time without a
sound.  The kobolds are building a bridge: two stout posts have been
driven into the rock, and a few ropes and planks reach a little way out
over the drop before they simply stop.  Anyone walking east from here
had better be able to fly.  The tunnel leads back west.
~
27 ad 0
D1
The tunnel opens up onto open air, and the fall to the chasm floor below
looks painful.  Better go back.
~
~
