0 -1 2706
E
bridge posts ropes planks~
The bridge is little more than a pair of posts, two ropes and a dozen
planks lashed between them, reaching perhaps ten feet out over the
chasm.  Beyond that there is nothing at all.  Whatever the kobolds are
expecting to come across, they have a long way to go yet.
~
S
#2708
Walking on Air Across the Chasm~
   You have taken a step into thin air, and are now getting a rapid
introduction to two principles of nature: gravity and terminal velocity.
The important word is terminal.
~
