#2746
Behind the Rubble~
   A low, hidden chamber lies behind the great heap of rubble, where the
old river tunnel was walled off by the kobolds' spoil.  This is where
the king keeps the things he does not trust his subjects to see: sacks,
chests and bundles, all of them stolen, all of them carefully counted
and marked with tally scratches on the wall.  A narrow gap between the
stones leads back east to the river channel.
~
